{"id":"zrtffer8stfrae78gnyatuaft","title":"被AI赶尽杀绝的独立音乐人","originalTitle":null,"summary":"独立音乐人张艺德认为，AI生成音乐的低成本和高产量正在挤压传统音乐人的生存空间。AI音乐在平台上的分成被压缩，导致音乐人收入大幅下降。张艺德建议音乐人通过现场演出和个人IP来维持生计，而不是依赖录音和版权收入。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"钛媒体"},"links":{"original":"https://www.tmtpost.com/8210473.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T06:57:06.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T08:15:56.182Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T08:15:56.182Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["研究报告"],"score":45,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"bcc66c03-a0f8-40e2-8823-55f28777b496","title":"AI生成音乐挤压独立音乐人收入，张艺德建议转型"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"脑极体","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"bcc66c03-a0f8-40e2-8823-55f28777b496","title":"AI生成音乐挤压独立音乐人收入，张艺德建议转型"}],"topics":[{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fwGQ83ImILj0","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}